  "summary": "Malicious code in @onereach/ui-components (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall hook (node setup.mjs) downloads the Bun runtime from github[.]com/oven-sh/bun/releases/download/bun-v1.3.13 and uses it to execute a bundled 727KB obfuscated script (math_init.js). The script is obfuscated with a large encoded string array and a custom decoder, and runs at install time on every machine that installs the package. A Vue UI components library has no legitimate reason to download a runtime and execute a large obfuscated payload during installation.",
